/E (An internship helps a student understand how the knowledge learned in college is used in a real working environment. The internship described in this report is structured around the role of a Junior Intern at Mahindra Automobile, with emphasis on automobile operations and basic technology practices, automobile operations, issue analysis, documentation, testing and teamwork.)
/Pg 15 0 R
