/Title (The scope of this internship is mainly educational. It covers the basic activities that a junior intern can perform with guidance from senior staff. It includes understanding requirements, analysing simple technical issues, preparing or modifying code/configuration where applicable, testing solutions, documenting observations and communicating progress.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 486 0 R
/Next 493 0 R
>>
endobj
490 0 obj
<<
/Title (The scope excludes confidential client data, production credentials, proprietary architecture details, restricted source code, security-sensitive information and any activity requiring unauthorised access. Such information should remain within the organisation's approved systems and policies.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 486 0 R
/Prev 493 0 R
>>
endobj
